========================================================================
COMPUTATIONAL ARCHITECTURE, PACKAGES, AND ENVIRONMENT SPECIFICATIONS
Project: Sleep Deprivation Meta-analysis (Cross-Platform Transcriptomics)
========================================================================

1. CORE SYSTEM & ENVIRONMENT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Operating System Platform   : Linux / macOS terminal environments
Base Programming Language   : R Version 4.4.1 (2024-06-14)
Bioconductor Environment    : Version 3.20

2. UPSTREAM RNA-SEQ PIPELINE BINARIES
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Quality Control Tracking    : FastQC v0.12.1
Sequence Quality Trimming   : Trimmomatic v0.39
Splice-Aware Read Alignment : STAR v2.7.10a
Reference Genome Base       : GRCm39 Mouse Genome (Ensembl / NCBI)
Abundance Quantification    : featureCounts (subread) v2.0.6
Transcriptome Annotations   : GENCODE vM32 Release

3. INDIVIDUAL PLATFORM DIFFERENTIALLY EXPRESSED GENE (DEG) ENGINES
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Microarray Array Parsing    : affy v1.84.0 (Robust Multi-array Average)
Microarray Linear Modeling  : limma v3.62.2 (Empirical Bayes Moderation)
RNA-seq Count Modeling     : DESeq2 v1.46.0 (Negative Binomial GLMs)

4. POOLED RESTRICTED MAXIMUM LIKELIHOOD (REML) META-ANALYSIS ENGINE
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Synthesis Framework         : metafor v4.6-0
Estimation Method Parameter : Restricted Maximum Likelihood (REML)
Variance Corrections        : Knapp–Hartung Adjustments (knha)
Joint Integration Test      : Fisher's Combined Probability Method (-2 * sum(ln(P)))
Multiple Testing Control    : Benjamini-Hochberg False Discovery Rate (FDR)

5. DATA WRANGLING, TIDYVERSE, & LOGISTICAL WORKFLOW UTILITIES
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data Frame Manipulations    : dplyr v1.1.4
Matrix Reshaping / Pivoting  : tidyr v1.3.1
Iterative List Functions    : purrr v1.0.2

6. REPRODUCIBLE PUBLICATION VISUALIZATION SUITES
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Base Programmatic Charting  : ggplot2 v3.5.1
Hierarchical Clustering Rows : pheatmap v1.0.12
Non-Overlapping Plot Labels  : ggrepel v0.9.6
Relational Matrix Parsing   : igraph v2.1.4
Network Layout / Topology   : ggraph v2.2.1

7. REVENUE RECOGNITION, FUNCTIONAL ENRICHMENT, & FLUID INTERACTION PLOTS
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Functional Pathway Mapping  : DAVID Functional Annotation Tool (2021 Update)
Interactome Database Source : STRING Database v12.0
Network Visualizer Engine   : Cytoscape Desktop v3.10
Centrality Topology Plugin  : cytoHubba
Sub-cluster Module Plugin   : MCODE (Molecular Complex Detection)

